!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
!! A detailed mechanism for the combustion of butyl formate 
!! 
!! contact S. Vranckx, RWTH Aachen, vranckx@swl.rwth-aachen.de or R.X. Fernandes, fernandes@swl.rwth-aachen.de
!!
!! this is the version of the butyl formate mechanism starting from:
!!
!! supporting info to 'An experimental and kinetic modelling study of n-butyl formate combustion'
!! submitted to Combustion and flame
!! 
!! starting mechanism Blanquart, Pitsch et al. +
!! 1) Burke H2/O2
!! 2) CO chemistry Haas, Vranckx et al ESSCI
!! 3) ethanol chemsitry: Lee, ranckx and Fernandes
!! 4) Butane model Healy et al.
!! 5) methyl formate mechanism Dooley et al.
!! 6) btfm + R reactions from Wassja or based on comparison with ethylformate and butanol, see below for details
!! 7) subsequent reactions of the btfm submechanism from RMG
!! 8) a few extra primary radical decomposition reactions added based on ethylformate mechanism Westbrook et al.
!! 9) low temperature chemistry included based on the n-butanol low temparute mechanism (Sarathy et al.)
!!
!!
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!

