CO+OH = CO2+H                             3.018E+05    1.86 -5.334E+02
! previous rate expression:
!CO+OH<=>CO2+H                            7.046e+04    2.053   -355.64
!     DUPLICATE
!CO+OH<=>CO2+H                            5.757e+12   -0.664    331.74
