CO+O2<=>CO2+O                            2.530E+12    0.00  4.770E+04
! previous rate:
!CO+O2<=>CO2+O                            1.050e+12    0.000  47700.05

CO+HO2<=>CO2+OH                           1.570e+05    2.180  17942.64

! updated by Stijn to Timonen et al., JPC, 91:692 (1987)
HCO+H = CO+H2                             7.230E+13    0.00  0.000E+00
!previous rate:
!HCO+H<=>CO+H2                            1.200e+14    0.000      0.00

HCO+O<=>CO+OH                            3.000e+13    0.000      0.00
HCO+O<=>CO2+H                            3.000e+13    0.000      0.00
HCO+OH<=>CO+H2O                          3.020e+13    0.000      0.00
HCO+M<=>CO+H+M                           4.748e+11    0.659  14873.80
H2/2.00/ H2O/0.00/ CO/1.75/ CO2/3.60/ 
HCO+O2<=>CO+HO2                          7.580e+12    0.000    409.89

!!! extra HCO reactions added by Stijn !!!

! 5 rxns - Tsang and Hampson, JPC Ref. Data, 15:1087 (1986)
HCO+HO2 = CO2+OH+H                       3.000E+13    0.00       0.00
HCO+HCO = H2+CO+CO                       3.000E+12    0.00       0.00
! Glarborg et al's paper (C&F, 132:629, 2003)
HCO+HCO = CH2O+CO                        3.000E+13    0.00       0.00



